<title>UK: BNG sets 200 mln Swiss franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 200 mln Swiss franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEETEN</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.625     MATURITY    20.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.5     PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    SWIS/AMST PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     NEG PLG    YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
